{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cStopped by yesterday at PAX East and am sooo exited to see this game! Survival as a genre is my absolute favorite and this game looks absolutely incredible.\u201d</i><br> <br><strong> </strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf0e Massive Open World </strong>\u2013 No loading screens, just awe-inspiring exploration, with stunning hand-crafted biomes that change with each new moon. Just when you think you\u2019ve got it figured out, there\u2019s something new to discover! <br>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.poster.avif?t=1768324039\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.webm?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/403029ac32d81bc86790a5409d1cce72.mp4?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 Real Nature - Recorded in Canada\u2019s North </strong>\u2013 The sounds you hear in the game are real! Our lead sound engineer lives in a fly-in community in the North and has been field recording them for years. You will feel like you\u2019re there too! <br> <br>\ud83e\udded<strong>Never Get Lost </strong>\u2013 No minimap to watch - you don\u2019t need it. Explore freely and when you\u2019re done for the day, fast travel back to camp from anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.poster.avif?t=1768324039\" width=594 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.webm?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/ba947c9842158bb9e3e13c1d3427e83a.mp4?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\ud83d\udc3b Don\u2019t Look Over Your Shoulder </strong>- The animals won\u2019t attack you (well, unless you really, really antagonize them). Who needs fake animal attacks - the true depth of and ingenuity of real survival is fun enough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.poster.avif?t=1768324039\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.webm?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/9bda0b9824191d5a0d47d4d5ed186413.mp4?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>\ud83c\udf72 No need to eat every 30 seconds </strong>\u2013 You only eat once a day at your fire, so you can focus on <i>being</i> in the world, rather than 4 different level meters. <br> <br><strong>\ud83c\udd98 Get Gifts and Hints from your fire </strong>\u2013 Think of the fire like a grandparent: they want you to become independent, but they\u2019ll help you out too. Of course you can always test your skill without their help in a challenge mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.poster.avif?t=1768324039\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.webm?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/64d537a381395e61a30b4f789fdddf1d.mp4?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf32No Cutting down trees </strong>\u2013 You have to build up your stores for winter, but instead of chopping down everything in sight, you can auto-harvest fallen trees from the woods (in real survival, chopping down a tree would be a terrible waste of energy if you could avoid it)<strong></strong><br><br> <br><strong>\ud83c\udf19 Make Progress Fast </strong>\u2013 Each Night you get to unlock new quests and lore from the fire. You can upgrade your camp, process and even fast-craft overnight <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.poster.avif?t=1768324039\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.webm?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/e5514ab7c33e6c7a3047eb654e128d26.mp4?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1fGo deep into Crafting - with the stars </strong>\u2013 Each new craft unlocks an animated sequence in the night sky where you discover how it\u2019s really built. Exciting for those of us who love to nerd out on cool details, but totally skippable for those who also just want to get on with the next day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.poster.avif?t=1768324039\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.webm?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/extras/4a3913dc8a8f93a38db08f8ebe7c3344.mp4?t=1768324039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673960?t=1768324039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/32e5ebb400ef516253731fe70147b1322314c029/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768324039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/5a7f5642f59c9ac870511c31d19768550478951f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768324039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673960/5a7f5642f59c9ac870511c31d19768550478951f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768324039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cStopped by yesterday at PAX East and am sooo exited to see this game! Survival as a genre is my absolute favorite and this game looks absolutely incredible.\u201d</i><br> <br><strong> </strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf0e Massive Open World </strong>\u2013 No loading screens, just awe-inspiring exploration, with stunning hand-crafted biomes that change with each new moon. Just when you think you\u2019ve got it figured out, there\u2019s something new to discover! <br>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 